---
title: "watson_contest_lifecycle (Sherlock Watsons)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_signup: watson provides github, discord, wallet
    q_signup --> q_repo_created: sherlock creates private github repo
    q_repo_created --> q_audit_active: contest starts
    q_audit_active --> q_submit_issues: watson finds vulnerabilities
    q_submit_issues --> q_submit_issues: submit issue to private repo
    q_submit_issues --> q_opt_out_check: contest ends
    q_opt_out_check --> q_opted_out: watson opts out of ranking (before contest end)
    q_opt_out_check --> q_ranked: watson stays in ranking
    q_opted_out --> q_payout_check: proceed to payout (no ranking impact)
    q_ranked --> q_payout_check: proceed to payout (ranking updated)
    q_payout_check --> q_criteria_gate: validate payout criteria
    q_criteria_gate --> q_paid: criteria met
    q_criteria_gate --> q_withheld: criteria not met, USDC withheld
    q_withheld --> q_paid: criteria met in future contest
    q_paid --> [*]: payout within 2 weeks of audit end

    note right of q_signup
        INV-001: Watson must provide github name, discord handle, wallet address
        INV-002: Wallet address determines payment destination
    end note

    note right of q_opt_out_check
        INV-003: Opt-out must be indicated before contest ends
        INV-004: Opted-out watson can still receive USDC payout
        INV-005: Lead Senior Watson cannot opt out of ranking
    end note
